["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/verificationUUID", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The UUID used by a verification management system or any other lifecycle management tool to uniquely identify a verification item. UUID, or universally unique ID, is a standard term to refer to verification items.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
